      "description": "MyJob Restricted // Marquette University Marquette University MyJob is Restricted MyJob is Restricted Marquette.edu // MyJob is Restricted to Campus or Marquette VPN You have reached this page because MyJob is a campus-restricted resource. myjob.mu.edu must be accessed from on-campus or via Marquette VPN. Please visit the Marquette VPN web page to arrange for off-campus access. If you have questions, contact the IT Services Help Desk at (414) 288-7799. \u0003 © 2017 Marquette University"
